# Spider-Man No More makes the enchanted creature lose all other abilities (CR 613.1f): Bot1 enchants Bot2's Llanowar Elves (a 1/1 Elf Druid with
# "{T}: Add {G}") on turn 3. It becomes a Citizen alone (its Elf and Druid types are overwritten, CR 205.1a), 1/1 with defender, and its
# mana ability is gone: on turn 4 it cannot be tapped for mana, though Bot2's Forest still can. Unenchanted, Bot2's second creature (Memnite)
# is untouched: still a 1/1 Construct.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Spider-Man No More
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Memnite
Forest x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
